ft_adjudication guidance (alt) : When in doubt between FT_ELIGIBLE and FT_SCREENED_OUT, lean toward FT_ELIGIBLE. Choose FT_SCREENED_OUT only when the title or full text states something that meets an exclusion criterion. That the full text does not state, mention, or confirm an inclusion criterion is not a ground to choose FT_SCREENED_OUT. When the full text is silent on a point, do not choose FT_SCREENED_OUT on that silence.
